{"3759140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nitroglycerine!", "steam_appid": 3759140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Just one run and we’re holding a ticket out of this place. But there is a catch - not all of us will make it to the end”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready for a real challenge!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive powerful heavy trucks, transport deadly cargo through treacherous and unpredictable route. It's not just a ride — it's a battle against the road, circumstances, and your own nerves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚛 Handle a big rig — feel the weight of every ton and every bump on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☠️ Nitroglycerin! — carelessness can be costly. One wrong move and the cargo turns into a fireball. Beware of overheating, impacts and shaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛤️ Rough road — narrow mountain trails, slippery bridges, bumpy roads and sudden landslides await anyone daring enough to hit the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Immersion — atmospheric sound design, interactive elements and realistic physics make every trip a tense cinematic experience. Feel like a real driver, stuck somewhere in destitution and despair, but with one last chance to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Quick sessions — they don't last long but demand maximum concentration. Perfect for those who appreciate a challenge and limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you deliver the cargo in one piece?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the ignition on and prepare for the toughest journey of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Just one run and we’re holding a ticket out of this place. But there is a catch - not all of us will make it to the end”</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/df3637893a7f5eacbbec3cbc3daf70f7.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready for a real challenge!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive powerful heavy trucks, transport deadly cargo through treacherous and unpredictable route. It's not just a ride — it's a battle against the road, circumstances, and your own nerves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚛 Handle a big rig — feel the weight of every ton and every bump on the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☠️ Nitroglycerin! — carelessness can be costly. One wrong move and the cargo turns into a fireball. Beware of overheating, impacts and shaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛤️ Rough road — narrow mountain trails, slippery bridges, bumpy roads and sudden landslides await anyone daring enough to hit the road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 Immersion — atmospheric sound design, interactive elements and realistic physics make every trip a tense cinematic experience. Feel like a real driver, stuck somewhere in destitution and despair, but with one last chance to break free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Quick sessions — they don't last long but demand maximum concentration. Perfect for those who appreciate a challenge and limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can you deliver the cargo in one piece?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the ignition on and prepare for the toughest journey of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/da92228f9ee8ceac3db0014dfe05511d.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.poster.avif?t=1767883128\" width=800 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.webm?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/extras/3187091c77b645047f307f7c2aeee6ad.mp4?t=1767883128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A challenging arcade simulator of transporting dangerous cargo on heavy trucks along a complex and unpredictable route. A short but extendable adventure. ", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, Belarusian, Serbian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Japanese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759140/c67329a9e3b72f565